Third-party content
========================================================================

AIGCNEWS is a personal aggregation and ranking tool. Content surfaced by
its pipelines — arXiv/Hugging Face papers, GitHub repository metadata,
news articles, Product Hunt and Hacker News items, X (Twitter) posts, and
WeChat official-account articles — remains the property of its original
authors, publishers, and platforms. The software stores metadata,
excerpts, and thumbnails solely to operate the reader interface and
claims no ownership over aggregated content. No platform content,
database dump, collected snapshot, or cached media from any deployment
of this project is licensed for redistribution or included in this
repository.

X (Twitter) and WeChat scraping implementations are not part of this
repository; they are loaded optionally from a private plugin package
behind feature flags, and the repository ships interfaces only. Operators
who enable such plugins are responsible for complying with the source
platforms' Terms of Service, robots policies, and applicable law, and for
safeguarding the credentials they configure.

Product names and marks referenced by this project — including X,
Twitter, WeChat, Product Hunt, Hacker News, arXiv, GitHub, and Hugging
Face — are the property of their respective owners. References are
nominative only; no affiliation with or endorsement by their owners is
implied.

Removal or correction requests concerning aggregated content may be
directed to the maintainer via the repository issue tracker.

