Third-party software
========================================================================

This project is built with open-source components, including FastAPI,
Starlette, Pydantic, SQLAlchemy, APScheduler, LangChain, PyMilvus,
Neo4j drivers, Vue.js, Vite, Pinia, Vue Router, and Tailwind CSS, each
licensed by its respective authors (predominantly MIT/Apache-2.0/BSD).
The complete dependency lists with exact versions are maintained in
backend/requirements.txt, backend/requirements.lock, and
frontend/package.json.

The optional, privately distributed X-ingestion plugin (not included in
this repository) builds upon twitter-cli, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (https://github.com/jackwener/twitter-cli).
